sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has implemented device model monitoring<br>and MonitoringCtrlr.Enabled = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: CSMS requests ClearVariableMonitoring ItemsPerMessage from CS

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for<br>the variable Power of ChargingStation

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (component = ChargingStation, variable = Power)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: componentVariable[0].component.name = "ChargingStation"<br>componentVariable[0].component.instance is omitted<br>componentVariable[0].variable.name = "Power"<br>componentVariable[0].variable.instance is omitted<br>monitoringCriteria is omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = EmptyResultSet)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for<br>the variable AvailabilityState of EVSE #1

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (component = EVSE, evse.id = 1, variable = AvailabilityState)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: componentVariable[1].component.name = "EVSE"<br>componentVariable[1].component.instance is omitted<br>componentVariable[1].component.evse.id = 1<br>componentVariable[1].variable.name = "AvailabilityState"<br>componentVariable[1].variable.instance is omitted<br>monitoringCriteria is omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop Repeated as often as needed to report all configuration variables
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyMonitoringReportRequest
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyMonitoringReportResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: Check that CSMS shows the monitor<br>for AvailabilityState for EVSE #1
